{"step_index":961,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T07:02:31Z","input_tokens":162410,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":650,"thinking":"Accessing the NAS requires using PowerShell from within the WSL environment due to character encoding limitations. A Base64 encoded UTF-16LE script will be employed to safely handle Japanese characters in the folder paths. The goal is to create the three specified folders on the network share.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"BypassSandbox":true,"CommandLine":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport base64\nimport subprocess\n\nps_bin = '/mnt/c/Windows/System32/WindowsPowerShell/v1.0/powershell.exe'\n\nps_script = r'''\n[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n$base = '\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research'\n\n$folders = @('真空層による表面破壊エネルギー', '周期数による表面破壊エネルギー', '実行コード')\n\nforeach ($f in $folders) {\n    $target = Join-Path $base $f\n    if (-not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $target)) {\n        New-Item -ItemType Directory -LiteralPath $target -Force | Out-Null\n        Write-Output ('CREATED: ' + $target)\n    } else {\n        Write-Output ('ALREADY_EXISTS: ' + $target)\n    }\n}\n'''\n\nencoded = base64.b64encode(ps_script.encode('utf-16-le')).decode('ascii')\nres = subprocess.run([ps_bin, '-NoProfile', '-NonInteractive', '-EncodedCommand', encoded], capture_output=True, text=True, encoding='cp932', errors='replace')\nprint('STDOUT:\\n', res.stdout)\nprint('STDERR:\\n', res.stderr)\nprint('RC:', res.returncode)\n\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"Create three folders in NAS"}}]}
